<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    What the widget picker shows before anything has been configured. Drawn
    rather than screenshotted because a screenshot would have to be a PNG per
    density, would go stale the first time the chart changed, and would bake in
    one particular afternoon's weather as if it meant something.

    It still has to be the shape of the real thing, though, or the picker is
    advertising a widget nobody gets: a line with its band around it, the band
    starting at the now marker because the hour behind it is measurement and a
    measurement has no ensemble to disagree with itself.
-->
